Cell["\<\
CountSectorsUnregulated computes the number of (unregulated) critical points \
of a Feynman integral on a given cut. Both generic kinematics but also a \
specific kinematic constraint can be given.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->586972977,ExpressionUUID->"b41f8bb2-dbad-4f03-9efe-038effe7d463"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",
